# SMKB Design System — AI Agent Rules

This project uses the **@smkb/design-ui** component library (including design tokens) built for Seminar Hakibutzim College (סמינר הקיבוצים).

---

## Rule 1 — Always use SMKB tokens for styling

Never write raw hex colors, pixel values, font sizes, or z-index numbers.
Always use CSS custom properties from the token system.

```css
/* ✅ correct */
color: var(--smkb-color-foreground);
padding: var(--smkb-space-4);
font-size: var(--smkb-font-size-md);
border-radius: var(--smkb-radius-md);
box-shadow: var(--smkb-shadow-sm);
z-index: var(--smkb-z-dropdown);

/* ❌ wrong */
color: #0f172a;
padding: 16px;
font-size: 1rem;
```

**Token categories available:**
- Colors: `--smkb-color-primary`, `--smkb-color-foreground`, `--smkb-color-surface`, `--smkb-color-border`, `--smkb-color-danger`, `--smkb-color-success`, `--smkb-color-warning`
- Spacing: `--smkb-space-1` through `--smkb-space-24` (0.25 rem increments)
- Typography: `--smkb-font-size-xs/sm/md/lg/xl/2xl`, `--smkb-font-weight-normal/medium/semibold/bold`
- Radius: `--smkb-radius-sm/md/lg/xl/full` — override `--smkb-radius-md` to change all corners at once
- Shadows: `--smkb-shadow-xs/sm/md/lg/xl`
- Motion: `--smkb-motion-duration-fast/normal/slow`, `--smkb-motion-easing-default/spring`
- Z-index: `--smkb-z-dropdown/sticky/overlay/modal/dialog/tooltip/toast`

→ Full token reference: **SMKB-UI.md § Token Reference**

