## Rule 2 — Always use SMKB components when a suitable one exists

Before writing any UI element, check the component list below. If a suitable component exists, use it. Only build a custom component if nothing in the library fits the need — and document why.

### Component Quick Reference

| Component | Use for | Key props |
|---|---|---|
| `SmkbButton` | Any clickable action | `variant` (primary/secondary/ghost/danger/on-primary/neutral-ghost), `size`, `loading`, `disabled`, `tag` |
| `SmkbIconButton` | Circular icon-only control (toolbar / header) | `icon` or default slot (SVG), `ariaLabel` (required), `variant`, `size`, `loading` |
| `SmkbBackButton` | Back navigation (icon follows `<html dir>`) | `ariaLabel` (required), `size`, `tag`, `href` (when `tag="a"`) — uses `neutral-ghost` icon button |
| `SmkbSegmentedControl` | Pill radiogroup for a single choice among options | `v-model`, `options` (`SmkbSegmentedOption`), `variant`, `showShortLabel` |
| `SmkbInput` | Text / number / email / password fields | `v-model`, `type`, `status`, `message`, `size`, `iconLeft/Right` |
| `SmkbSelect` | Dropdown option picker | `v-model`, `options`, `placeholder`, `status`, `message` |
| `SmkbAutocomplete` | Type-ahead / combobox | `v-model`, `options`, `minChars`, `openOnFocus`, `status` |
| `SmkbCheckbox` | Boolean or grouped checkboxes | `v-model`, `value`, `label`, `indeterminate` |
| `SmkbRadio` | Single-selection radio group | `v-model`, `value`, `label`, `name` |
| `SmkbSwitch` | Toggle on/off | `v-model`, `label`, `size` |
| `SmkbSlider` | Numeric range input | `v-model`, `min`, `max`, `step` |
| `SmkbField` | Label + control + message wrapper | `label`, `message`, `status`, `required`, `horizontal` |
| `SmkbDialog` | Modal dialogs / confirmations | `v-model:open`, `title`, `size`, `closable`, slots: `footer({close})` |
| `SmkbModal` | Alias for SmkbDialog | Same as SmkbDialog |
| `SmkbTable` | Data tables | `data`, `columns`, `loading`, `paginated`, `striped`, `hoverable` |
| `SmkbPagination` | Page navigation | `v-model:currentPage`, `total`, `perPage` |
| `SmkbTabs` | Tab navigation | `v-model`, `tabs` (array of {label, value}) |
| `SmkbSteps` | Step/progress indicator | `v-model`, `steps` (array of {label}), `clickable` |
| `SmkbCollapse` | Accordion / expand-collapse | `v-model:open`, `title`, slot: `trigger` |
| `SmkbDropdown` | Contextual menus / dropdowns | `v-model:open`, `closeOnClick`, slots: `trigger`, `default` |
| `SmkbTooltip` | Hover/focus tooltip | `label`, `position` (top/bottom/left/right), `delay` |
| `SmkbSidebar` | Off-canvas sidebar / drawer | `v-model:open`, `position` (left/right), `closable` |
| `SmkbNotification` | Toast / banner alerts | `variant`, `closable`, `duration`, `message` |
| `SmkbLoading` | Loading overlay / spinner | `active`, `fullPage`, `label` |
| `SmkbSkeleton` | Content placeholder while loading | `count`, `width`, `height`, `circle`, `animated` |
| `SmkbIcon` | SVG icons from files in the library (`src/icons/svg/`) | `icon` (id matching `*.svg`), `size`, or **default slot** for custom SVG |
| `SmkbLogo` | SMKB brand logo | `lang` (heb/eng), `layout` (horizontal/vertical/icon), `theme` (auto/light/dark), `width` |
| `SmkbAppHeader` | Fixed application header | `headerItems`, `menuItems`, `v-model` (lang), `languages`, `showLanguage`, `showAccessibility`, slots: `logo`, `actions` |
| `SmkbAccessibility` | Accessibility toolbar (trigger + side panel) | `lang` (he/en), `showTrigger` (true), `v-model:open` |
| `SmkbTableColumn` | Column definition child for SmkbTable | `field`, `label`, `sortable`, `width`, `align` |

→ Full API (all props, emits, slots): **SMKB-UI.md § Component Catalog**

