## Rule 3 — Read the documentation before UI work

At the start of any task that involves UI, forms, layout, or styling:

1. Read **SMKB-UI.md** (in this project root) — it contains the full token reference and complete component API
2. Confirm which components and tokens are relevant to the task
3. Proceed with implementation using only SMKB components and tokens

