## Rule 4 — Setup requirements

Every app that uses this library must import these in order in the entry point (`main.ts`):

```ts
import '@smkb/design-ui/tokens.css'       // Layer 1+2 tokens (light theme, custom fonts)
import '@smkb/design-ui/tokens-dark.css'  // Dark theme overrides
import '@smkb/design-ui/styles'           // Component styles + base CSS

import { createApp } from 'vue'
import { createSmkb } from '@smkb/design-ui'  // Registers all components globally

const app = createApp(App)
app.use(createSmkb())
app.mount('#app')
```

**Power Apps / strict CSP environments:** Replace `tokens.css` with `tokens-nofonts.css` to skip custom font loading (Power Apps blocks binary font assets):

```ts
import '@smkb/design-ui/tokens-nofonts.css'  // ← no @font-face, system fonts only
import '@smkb/design-ui/tokens-dark.css'
import '@smkb/design-ui/styles'
```

