## Rule 5 — Dark mode & RTL

- **Dark mode**: Add `data-theme="dark"` to `<html>` or any ancestor element
- **RTL**: Set `dir="rtl"` on `<html>` — all components use CSS logical properties and will flip automatically
- `SmkbAppHeader` handles both: its language toggle sets `document.documentElement.lang` and `dir` automatically
